        "raw_bytes": 1794,
        "lf_bytes": 1794,
        "raw_sha256": "7925618a142c1514a962d18e4c580f39fa4bc85426ba98de4c84a8b90e6bdc42",
        "lf_sha256": "7925618a142c1514a962d18e4c580f39fa4bc85426ba98de4c84a8b90e6bdc42"
      },
      "byte_range": [
        775053,
        776847
      ],
      "literal_source_text": "\\rho_{\\rm mac}\\coloneqq\\frac{1-\\alpha\\eta}{1+\\alpha\\eta}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\gamma_{\\rm gap}\\coloneqq\\sqrt{1-\\rho_{\\rm mac}^{2}}=\\frac{2\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta}}{1+\\alpha\\eta}\\,. (B.12)"
    },
    {
      "id": "S1.p1",
      "coverage": "NODE",
      "reason": "Original global C2 potential/two Hessian bounds and positive alpha order; actual consumer binder context.",
      "qualified_raw_slice": {
        "path": "E:/Samplinglib/runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-real-defect-root61/next-macro-source62/primary-S1-p1-dffe0a792ef0.raw.snapshot",
        "raw_bytes": 3603,
        "lf_bytes": 3603,
        "raw_sha256": "a9bc657fb926368561ab2657dfbfbf6a7a0ba5b8c2122f8d1fb8510a0a975262",
        "lf_sha256": "a9bc657fb926368561ab2657dfbfbf6a7a0ba5b8c2122f8d1fb8510a0a975262"
      },
      "qualified_LF_slice": {
        "path": "E:/Samplinglib/runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-real-defect-root61/next-macro-source62/primary-S1-p1-dffe0a792ef0.LF.snapshot",
        "raw_bytes": 3603,
        "lf_bytes": 3603,
        "raw_sha256": "a9bc657fb926368561ab2657dfbfbf6a7a0ba5b8c2122f8d1fb8510a0a975262",
        "lf_sha256": "a9bc657fb926368561ab2657dfbfbf6a7a0ba5b8c2122f8d1fb8510a0a975262"
      },
      "byte_range": [
        47126,
        50729
      ],
      "literal_source_text": "We study the problem of sampling from the probability measure \\mu(\\mathrm{d}x)=Z^{-1}e^{-V(x)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x on \\mathbb{R}^{d} , where V\\in C^{2}(\\mathbb{R}^{d}) satisfies, for 0<\\alpha\\leq\\beta , \\alpha I\\preceq\\nabla^{2}V(x)\\preceq\\beta I\\,,\\hskip 20.00003ptx\\in\\mathbb{R}^{d}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\kappa\\coloneqq\\tfrac{\\beta}{\\alpha}\\,. (1.1) The main result of this paper is the following."
    },
    {
      "id": "S2.E6",
      "coverage": "NODE",
      "reason": "Printed normalized joint density exp[-V(x)-||x-y||²/(2η)]; actual J context.",
      "qualified_raw_slice": {
        "path": "E:/Samplinglib/runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-real-defect-root61/next-macro-source62/primary-S2-E6-dffe0a792ef0.raw.snapshot",
        "raw_bytes": 1993,
        "lf_bytes": 1993,
        "raw_sha256": "1f01e27c8eb38fd05a57d820c65ee6b36832171cce845e8cd1b52f4588526375",
        "lf_sha256": "1f01e27c8eb38fd05a57d820c65ee6b36832171cce845e8cd1b52f4588526375"
      },
      "qualified_LF_slice": {
        "path": "E:/Samplinglib/runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-real-defect-root61/next-macro-source62/primary-S2-E6-dffe0a792ef0.LF.snapshot",
        "raw_bytes": 1993,
        "lf_bytes": 1993,
        "raw_sha256": "1f01e27c8eb38fd05a57d820c65ee6b36832171cce845e8cd1b52f4588526375",
        "lf_sha256": "1f01e27c8eb38fd05a57d820c65ee6b36832171cce845e8cd1b52f4588526375"
      },
      "byte_range": [
        96222,
        98215
      ],
      "literal_source_text": "\\pi_{\\eta}(\\mathrm{d}x\\,\\mathrm{d}y)\\propto\\exp\\Bigl\\{-V(x)-\\frac{\\|x-y\\|^{2}}{2\\eta}\\Bigr\\}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\,. (2.6)"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2.E7",
